{"id":"gasolina","lemma":"gasolina","pos":"noun","rank":1845,"glosses":["petrol, gasoline"],"ipa":"/ɡasoˈlina/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"gasolinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-gasolina.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nos quedamos sin gasolina.","en":"We've run out of gasoline.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514959"},{"text":"Nos hemos quedado sin gasolina.","en":"We have run out of gas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459732"},{"text":"¿Quién va a pagar la gasolina?","en":"Who's paying for the gas?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518970"},{"text":"La gasolina es utilizada como combustible.","en":"Gasoline is used for fuel.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527222"},{"text":"A mi coche no le queda gasolina.","en":"My car is out of gas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454939"}]}